<section class="not-content">
  <h2>How Mobius works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <p><strong>Start.</strong> Tell the Coordinator about a goal, or write an issue. The Triager discusses a new issue with you and proposes a Workstream with a Brief. You approve it.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><strong>Plan.</strong> The Lead of the Workstream turns the Brief into task issues. You talk to the Lead in the chat of the Workstream.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><strong>Build.</strong> An Implementer writes the code in its own git worktree, runs the local check, and opens a draft pull request.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><strong>Review.</strong> A Reviewer with another Harness or another model reads the diff. The Implementer fixes each finding. When CI fails, a Diagnoser reads the job logs, and a fix round starts.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><strong>Merge.</strong> The Lead checks the pull request against the issue and approves it. You get an Inbox item, and you merge.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

